# wear/woman/tile_checks: the woman's checks: a woven check, a pattern line every third row and every fourth column;
# laid as a tile over her garments' cloth in the pattern slot, the cloth's shading kept (tags tile; doll.h). GARB-W (P2b).
use person
body woman
role overlay checks
legend X pattern 2
layer torso
anchor neck
keys rest
tags tile

view D key rest origin 0 0
|XXXX
|X...
|X...
